#: frontend/ui/quickstart.lua:320
msgid ""
"## While reading <a id=\"reading\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"table\"><div>\n"
"\n"
"You can change the font\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ "
"Font**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Make font bigger\n"
"\n"
"**BOTTOM MENU ➔ ![Textsize](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.textsize.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Make font bolder\n"
"\n"
"**BOTTOM MENU ➔ ![Contrast](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.contrast.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Invert the colors (white text on black)\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Settings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) ➔ "
"Night mode**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Change many formatting options\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ "
"Style tweaks**\n"
"\n"
"</div></div>\n"
msgstr ""
"## Skaitymo metu <a id=\"reading\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"table\"><div>\n"
"\n"
"Galite pakeisti šriftą\n"
"\n"
"**VIRŠUTINIS MENIU ➔ ![Rinkmenos nustatymai](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ Šriftas**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Padidinti šriftą\n"
"\n"
"**APATINIS MENIU ➔ ![Teksto dydis](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.textsize.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Padaryti šriftą paryškintesnį\n"
"\n"
"**APATINIS MENIU ➔ ![Kontrastas](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.contrast.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Invertuoti spalvas (baltas tekstas juodame fone)\n"
"\n"
"**VIRŠUTINIS MENIU ➔ ![Nustatymai](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.settings.svg) ➔ Nakties režimas**\n"
